# Everything here is a local build artifact or dependency tree that Vercel
# rebuilds itself on the build machine. Without this file the CLI uploads the
# whole 3.6GB working directory and the deploy is rejected outright: the
# per-file 100MB limit is exceeded by the platform-specific @next/swc
# binaries, the Turborepo cache archive, and the Turbopack dev cache.
node_modules
.next
.turbo
out
dist
build

# Local env files never belong in a deployment upload - runtime configuration
# is supplied by Vercel environment variables instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local-only noise
.git
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage
